          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चिघळणे — cighaḷṇe — \"to worsen; to fester\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वेळेवर बोलणं झालं नाही, म्हणून वाद चिघळला. veḷevar bolṇaṁ jhālaṁ nāhī, mhaṇūn vād cighaḷlā. Nobody talked in time, so the dispute festered."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो चिघळला, to cighaḷlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of a wound or a quarrel left alone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चिघळणे (cighaḷṇe) is a Marathi verb whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
