              "text": "सामोरे जाणे — sāmore jāṇe — \"to confront; to face\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ती अडचणींना धैर्याने सामोरी गेली. tī aḍcaṇīnnā dhairyāne sāmorī gelī. She faced the difficulties bravely."
            },
