              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सामोरे जाणे (sāmore jāṇe) joins सामोरे, \"in front\", inherited from Sanskrit saṁmukha, \"facing\" (CDIAL 12982 lists Marathi sāmorā), to जाणे, \"to go\": to go up face to face."
            }
